    "detailed_description": "\u25bdSynopsis: This is a visual novel game featuring toxic wave of electricity with a gameplay duration of 5-10 minutes. You will spend some bedtime moments with your \u201cbest friend\u201d that can be either enjoyable or less pleasant. Will you take the medicine?<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25bdWarning: This game contains psychological horror, meta-game elements, and distressing episodes of mental disorder, which may cause intense discomfort.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25bdDisclaimer: Claiming that \u201cthis game is based on real events\u201d may easily lead others to identify specific individuals through their experiences. Therefore, please consider this game solely as a combination of abstract concepts and a textual gaming experience.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe author is a student developer and a fan of &quot;\u3069\u304f\u3067\u3093\u3071&quot; games.This game pays homage to a game &quot;Milk inside a bag of milk inside a bag of milk&quot; that the author holds in high regard and really loves.You can see more information about me in the txt document in the game folder.",
